WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.198
Here, try this.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.318
Lift your hand.

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.918
Your shoulder goes first.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:05.838
Then, let your wrist catch up.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.358
See that little delay?

00:00:07.476 --> 00:00:09.598
That's what makes the gesture feel alive.
